/Alt (Flowchart illustrating a data analysis process in five stages: Data Preprocessing, Preliminary FDD Identification, Refined SSI-COV Identification, Spurious Mode Elimination, and Frequency-Environment Correlation Analysis. Each stage contains specific tasks, such as "Raw data acquisition," "High-quality data segment extraction," "Low-pass filtering," and "Modal clustering analysis," leading to correlations with wind direction, wind speed, and temperature. Arrows indicate progression and dependencies between tasks.)
